<a name="anc_a" id="anc_a" class="anchor"></a>
<div id="introduction">
  <div class="container">
    <p>The statue commonly known as Kamakura Daibutsu (Great Buddha of Kamakura), <br>
a colossal copper image of Amida-butsu (Amitabha Buddha), is the principle image of Kotoku-in.<br>
The fact that it sits in the open air makes it unusual amongst large Buddha statues in Japan.</p>
    <a href="about.html" class="btn-intro">＞ The Great Buddha and Kotoku-in</a> </div>
</div>
